022600 SECT-CM104M-0001 SECTION.                                        CM1044.2
022700 CM104M-INIT.                                                     CM1044.2
022800     OPEN     OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.                                  CM1044.2
022900     MOVE "CM104M     " TO TEST-ID.                               CM1044.2
