080100 DEBUG-LINE-WRITE-04.                                             DB1014.2
080200     MOVE "DEBUG-LINE-TEST-04" TO PAR-NAME.                       DB1014.2
080300     PERFORM PRINT-DETAIL.                                        DB1014.2
