021300 START-UP SECTION.                                                DB1034.2
021400     USE FOR DEBUGGING ON OPEN-FILES.                             DB1034.2
021500 BEGIN-START-UP.                                                  DB1034.2
021600     MOVE 1 TO RESULT-FLAG.                                       DB1034.2
021700 DB-COMMON.                                                       DB1034.2
