024300     USE FOR DEBUGGING ON DO-NOTHING-1.                           DB1034.2
024400 BEGIN-PERFORM-THRU.                                              DB1034.2
024500     PERFORM DB-COMMON.                                           DB1034.2
024600     ADD 1 TO RESULT-FLAG.                                        DB1034.2
