043200     PERFORM GEN-LOOP.                                            DB1044.2
043300     MOVE 97 TO XRECORD-NUMBER (1).                               DB1044.2
043400     PERFORM GEN-LOOP.                                            DB1044.2
043500     MOVE 96 TO XRECORD-NUMBER (1).                               DB1044.2
043600     PERFORM GEN-LOOP.                                            DB1044.2
