042900 LINK-TEST-07-03.                                                 IC1084.2
043000     ADD 1 TO REC-CT.                                             IC1084.2
043100     IF DN9 EQUAL TO "B"                                          IC1084.2
043200         PERFORM PASS                                             IC1084.2
043300         GO TO LINK-WRITE-07-03.                                  IC1084.2
043400 LINK-FAIL-07-03.                                                 IC1084.2
