044000     PERFORM PRINT-DETAIL.                                        IC1084.2
044100     GO TO CCVS-EXIT.                                             IC1084.2
044200 CCVS-EXIT SECTION.                                               IC1084.2
044300 CCVS-999999.                                                     IC1084.2
044400     GO TO CLOSE-FILES.                                           IC1084.2
