044200 CNCL-TEST-01-02.                                                 IC2034.2
044300     ADD 1 TO REC-CT.                                             IC2034.2
044400     IF DN2 IS EQUAL TO "YES"                                     IC2034.2
044500         PERFORM PASS                                             IC2034.2
044600         GO TO CNCL-WRITE-01-02.                                  IC2034.2
