047300     CANCEL ID1.                                                  IC2034.2
047400     MOVE 1 TO DN3.                                               IC2034.2
047500     MOVE SPACE TO DN2, DN4.                                      IC2034.2
047600     MOVE ZERO TO DN1.                                            IC2034.2
