049000     MOVE 1 TO CORRECT-18V0.                                      IC2034.2
049100     MOVE DN1 TO COMPUTED-18V0.                                   IC2034.2
049200     MOVE "DN1 INCORRECT" TO RE-MARK.                             IC2034.2
049300 CNCL-WRITE-02-01.                                                IC2034.2
