003800     SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO                                  IC2064.2
003900     XXXXX055.                                                    IC2064.2
004000 DATA DIVISION.                                                   IC2064.2
004100 FILE SECTION.                                                    IC2064.2
004200 FD  PRINT-FILE.                                                  IC2064.2
