054600     MOVE   "AVAILABLE  ON NOT ON" TO FEATURE.                    IC2224.2
054700     MOVE    0 TO CALL-FLAG.                                      IC2224.2
054800     MOVE   "X" TO EXCEPTION-PATH-FLAG.                           IC2224.2
054900     MOVE   "X-28 5.2.4 (2)" TO ANSI-REFERENCE.                   IC2224.2
