020800 CCVS1 SECTION.                                                   IC2284.2
020900 OPEN-FILES.                                                      IC2284.2
021000     OPEN     OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.                                  IC2284.2
021100     MOVE CCVS-PGM-ID TO TEST-ID. MOVE CCVS-PGM-ID TO ID-AGAIN.   IC2284.2
