041500*    1974 STANDARD (ANSI DOCUMENT REFERENCE: X3.23-1974; ISO   *  IC2334.2
041600*    DOCUMENT REFERENCE: ISO-1989-1978).                       *  IC2334.2
041700*                                                              *  IC2334.2
