061400     MOVE "F-INTEGER-17" TO PAR-NAME.                             IF1114.2
061500     PERFORM  PRINT-DETAIL.                                       IF1114.2
061600*****************TEST (r) ******************************          IF1114.2
061700 F-INTEGER-18.                                                    IF1114.2
061800     MOVE ZERO TO WS-INT.                                         IF1114.2
061900 F-INTEGER-TEST-18.                                               IF1114.2
