062100     IF WS-INT = -4 THEN                                          IF1114.2
062200                    PERFORM PASS                                  IF1114.2
062300     ELSE                                                         IF1114.2
062400                    MOVE  -4  TO CORRECT-N                        IF1114.2
062500                    MOVE WS-INT TO COMPUTED-N                     IF1114.2
062600                    PERFORM FAIL.                                 IF1114.2
