017500 01  HYPHEN-LINE.                                                 IF1134.2
017600     02 FILLER  PIC IS X VALUE IS SPACE.                          IF1134.2
017700     02 FILLER  PIC IS X(65)    VALUE IS "************************IF1134.2
017800-    "*****************************************".                 IF1134.2
017900     02 FILLER  PIC IS X(54)    VALUE IS "************************IF1134.2
