037700 F-LENGTH-TEST-05.                                                IF1154.2
037800     COMPUTE WS-INT = FUNCTION LENGTH(M).                         IF1154.2
037900     IF WS-INT = 17 THEN                                          IF1154.2
038000                        PERFORM PASS                              IF1154.2
038100     ELSE                                                         IF1154.2
