041000*****************TEST (g) ******************************          IF1154.2
041100 F-LENGTH-07.                                                     IF1154.2
041200     MOVE ZERO TO WS-INT.                                         IF1154.2
041300 F-LENGTH-TEST-07.                                                IF1154.2
041400     COMPUTE WS-INT = FUNCTION LENGTH(N) + 2.                     IF1154.2
