044200     PERFORM  DE-LETE.                                            IF1154.2
044300     GO TO    F-LENGTH-WRITE-08.                                  IF1154.2
044400 F-LENGTH-WRITE-08.                                               IF1154.2
044500     MOVE "F-LENGTH-08" TO PAR-NAME.                              IF1154.2
044600     PERFORM  PRINT-DETAIL.                                       IF1154.2
