028900     MOVE   TEST-CORRECT TO PRINT-REC PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES. IF1254.2
029000     MOVE   SPACES TO COR-ANSI-REFERENCE.                         IF1254.2
029100 FAIL-ROUTINE-EX. EXIT.                                           IF1254.2
029200 BAIL-OUT.                                                        IF1254.2
