050400     PERFORM  DE-LETE.                                            IF1314.2
050500     GO TO    F-RANDOM-WRITE-08.                                  IF1314.2
050600 F-RANDOM-WRITE-08.                                               IF1314.2
050700     MOVE "F-RANDOM-08" TO PAR-NAME.                              IF1314.2
