025900      ADD ERROR-COUNTER TO ERROR-HOLD ADD INSPECT-COUNTER TO      IF1354.2
026000      ERROR-HOLD. ADD DELETE-COUNTER TO ERROR-HOLD.               IF1354.2
026100      ADD PASS-COUNTER TO ERROR-HOLD.                             IF1354.2
