026300      MOVE ERROR-HOLD TO CCVS-E-4-2.                              IF1354.2
026400      MOVE CCVS-E-4 TO CCVS-E-2-2.                                IF1354.2
026500      MOVE CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           IF1354.2
