056500         PERFORM FAIL                                             IX1054.2
056600         MOVE "KEY00144" TO CORRECT-A                             IX1054.2
056700         MOVE "***INVALID KEY***" TO COMPUTED-A                   IX1054.2
056800         MOVE "INVAILD KEY IX-FR1" TO RE-MARK                     IX1054.2
