082500     READ IX-FS3.                                                 IX1094.2
082600     IF EOF-FLAG EQUAL TO 1                                       IX1094.2
082700         GO TO REA-TEST-F1-01-1.                                  IX1094.2
082800     MOVE IX-FS3R1-F-G-240 TO FILE-RECORD-INFO (1).               IX1094.2
