054100     MOVE HYPHEN-LINE TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.        IX1164.2
054200 END-ROUTINE.                                                     IX1164.2
054300     MOVE HYPHEN-LINE TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 5 TIMES.IX1164.2
054400 END-RTN-EXIT.                                                    IX1164.2
