059600 FAIL-ROUTINE.                                                    IX1164.2
059700     IF     COMPUTED-X NOT EQUAL TO SPACE                         IX1164.2
059800            GO TO   FAIL-ROUTINE-WRITE.                           IX1164.2
059900     IF     CORRECT-X NOT EQUAL TO SPACE GO TO FAIL-ROUTINE-WRITE.IX1164.2
