061600     MOVE   ANSI-REFERENCE TO INF-ANSI-REFERENCE.                 IX1164.2
061700     MOVE   XXINFO TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   IX1164.2
061800     MOVE   SPACES TO INF-ANSI-REFERENCE.                         IX1164.2
