068200     MOVE "TEST(S) DELETED     " TO ENDER-DESC.                   IX2114.2
068300     MOVE CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           IX2114.2
068400      IF   INSPECT-COUNTER EQUAL TO ZERO                          IX2114.2
