041700 PASS.  MOVE "PASS " TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO PASS-COUNTER.           IX2164.2
041800 FAIL.  MOVE "FAIL*" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO ERROR-COUNTER.          IX2164.2
041900 DE-LETE.  MOVE "*****" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO DELETE-COUNTER.      IX2164.2
