030800     MOVE CCVS-C-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   NC1024.2
030900     MOVE HYPHEN-LINE TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.        NC1024.2
