033700      IF   INSPECT-COUNTER EQUAL TO ZERO                          NC1024.2
033800          MOVE "NO " TO ERROR-TOTAL                               NC1024.2
033900      ELSE MOVE INSPECT-COUNTER TO ERROR-TOTAL.                   NC1024.2
