034200     MOVE CCVS-E-3 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           NC1024.2
034300 WRITE-LINE.                                                      NC1024.2
034400     ADD 1 TO RECORD-COUNT.                                       NC1024.2
