038000 PASS.  MOVE "PASS " TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO PASS-COUNTER.           NC1054.2
038100 FAIL.  MOVE "FAIL*" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO ERROR-COUNTER.          NC1054.2
