043200 PASS.  MOVE "PASS " TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO PASS-COUNTER.           NC1064.2
043300 FAIL.  MOVE "FAIL*" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO ERROR-COUNTER.          NC1064.2
043400 DE-LETE.  MOVE "*****" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO DELETE-COUNTER.      NC1064.2
