026300 END-RTN-EXIT.                                                    NC1144.2
026400     MOVE CCVS-E-1 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   NC1144.2
026500 END-ROUTINE-1.                                                   NC1144.2
026600      ADD ERROR-COUNTER TO ERROR-HOLD ADD INSPECT-COUNTER TO      NC1144.2
