035400     MOVE   ANSI-REFERENCE TO INF-ANSI-REFERENCE.                 NC1344.2
035500     MOVE   XXINFO TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   NC1344.2
035600     MOVE   SPACES TO INF-ANSI-REFERENCE.                         NC1344.2
