048000     MOVE SPACES TO PRINT-REC.                                    NC1354.2
048100     MOVE "SPACES BETWEEN EACH NUMBER ON A LINE --- THE NUMBERS   NC1354.2
048200-      "001 THRU 020 SHOULD FORM THE FIRST LINE ---" TO PRINT-REC.NC1354.2
