035200     MOVE CCVS-C-1 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           NC1704.2
035300     MOVE CCVS-C-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   NC1704.2
