036700      MOVE CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           NC1704.2
036800  END-ROUTINE-12.                                                 NC1704.2
036900      MOVE "TEST(S) FAILED" TO ENDER-DESC.                        NC1704.2
037000     IF       ERROR-COUNTER IS EQUAL TO ZERO                      NC1704.2
