035700 END-RTN-EXIT.                                                    NC1714.2
035800     MOVE CCVS-E-1 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   NC1714.2
035900 END-ROUTINE-1.                                                   NC1714.2
036000      ADD ERROR-COUNTER TO ERROR-HOLD ADD INSPECT-COUNTER TO      NC1714.2
