037000 OPEN-FILES.                                                      NC1754.2
037100     OPEN     OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.                                  NC1754.2
037200     MOVE CCVS-PGM-ID TO TEST-ID. MOVE CCVS-PGM-ID TO ID-AGAIN.   NC1754.2
037300     MOVE    SPACE TO TEST-RESULTS.                               NC1754.2
