037500     GO TO CCVS1-EXIT.                                            NC1754.2
037600 CLOSE-FILES.                                                     NC1754.2
037700     PERFORM END-ROUTINE THRU END-ROUTINE-13. CLOSE PRINT-FILE.   NC1754.2
