040700     MOVE     SPACE TO RE-MARK.                                   NC2044.2
040800 HEAD-ROUTINE.                                                    NC2044.2
040900     MOVE CCVS-H-1  TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.  NC2044.2
