055500 PAR-INIT-F2-1.                                                   NC2084.2
055600     MOVE "PAR-TEST-F2-1         " TO PAR-NAME.                   NC2084.2
055700     MOVE "IV-20 4.3.8.1 RULE 6" TO ANSI-REFERENCE.               NC2084.2
055800 PAR-TEST-F2-1.                                                   NC2084.2
