056500     PERFORM DE-LETE.                                             NC2084.2
056600     GO TO PAR-WRITE-F2-1.                                        NC2084.2
056700 PAR-FAIL-F2-1.                                                   NC2084.2
056800     PERFORM FAIL.                                                NC2084.2
