036100Y        MOVE CCVS-C-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD PERFORM WRT-LN 2 TIMES     NC2094.2
036200Y        MOVE HYPHEN-LINE TO DUMMY-RECORD PERFORM WRT-LN          NC2094.2
036300Y        MOVE DUMMY-HOLD TO DUMMY-RECORD                          NC2094.2
