025800     MOVE     SPACE TO RE-MARK.                                   NC2144.2
025900 HEAD-ROUTINE.                                                    NC2144.2
026000     MOVE CCVS-H-1  TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.  NC2144.2
