002500*    OPTIONAL WORDS "TRUE" AND "FALSE" ARE USED AS SELECTION   *  NC2254.2
002600*    SUBJECTS AND SELECTION OBJECTS.                           *  NC2254.2
002700*    MULTIPLE SELECTION SUBJECTS AND SETS OF SELECTION         *  NC2254.2
