033700     IF     COMPUTED-X NOT EQUAL TO SPACE                         NC2344.2
033800            GO TO    FAIL-ROUTINE-WRITE.                          NC2344.2
033900     IF     CORRECT-X NOT EQUAL TO SPACE GO TO FAIL-ROUTINE-WRITE.NC2344.2
