038400     MOVE "CHECK-ENTRIES" TO PAR-NAME.                            NC2344.2
038500     MOVE "GRP02" TO GRP-HOLD-AREA.                               NC2344.2
038600     MOVE 02 TO SUB-2.                                            NC2344.2
