062300     PERFORM PRINT-DETAIL.                                        NC2504.2
062400 IF--TEST-2.                                                      NC2504.2
062500     IF SPACES EQUAL TO IF-D4 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL.     NC2504.2
062600*        NOTE FIGURATIVE SPACES VS ALPHANUMERIC FIELD.            NC2504.2
