063200     PERFORM PRINT-DETAIL.                                        NC2504.2
063300 IF--TEST-3.                                                      NC2504.2
063400     IF QUOTES EQUAL TO IF-D5 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL.     NC2504.2
063500*        NOTE FIGURATIVE QUOTES VS ALPHANUMERIC FIELD.            NC2504.2
