046500Y    IF RECORD-COUNT GREATER 50                                   NC2524.2
046600Y        MOVE DUMMY-RECORD TO DUMMY-HOLD                          NC2524.2
046700Y        MOVE SPACE TO DUMMY-RECORD                               NC2524.2
