042300     IF REC-CT NOT EQUAL TO ZERO                                  NC2544.2
042400             MOVE "." TO PARDOT-X                                 NC2544.2
042500             MOVE REC-CT TO DOTVALUE.                             NC2544.2
042600     MOVE     TEST-RESULTS TO PRINT-REC. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.      NC2544.2
