048700Y        MOVE CCVS-C-2  TO DUMMY-RECORD  PERFORM WRT-LN           NC2544.2
048800Y        MOVE HYPHEN-LINE TO DUMMY-RECORD PERFORM WRT-LN          NC2544.2
048900Y        MOVE DUMMY-HOLD TO DUMMY-RECORD                          NC2544.2
