036800     MOVE CCVS-C-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   OBSQ34.2
036900     MOVE HYPHEN-LINE TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.        OBSQ34.2
037000 END-ROUTINE.                                                     OBSQ34.2
