039900     MOVE    SPACE TO TEST-RESULTS.                               RL1194.2
040000     PERFORM HEAD-ROUTINE THRU COLUMN-NAMES-ROUTINE.              RL1194.2
040100     MOVE    ZERO TO REC-SKL-SUB.                                 RL1194.2
