001900*            RECORDS.  SECONDLY, RECORDS OF THER FILE ARE         RL2034.2
002000*            SELECTIVELY DELETED AND THIRDLY THE ACCURACY OF EACH RL2034.2
002100*            RECORD IN THE FILE IS AGAIN VERIFIED.                RL2034.2
