041400 FAIL.  MOVE "FAIL*" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO ERROR-COUNTER.          RL2054.2
041500 DE-LETE.  MOVE "*****" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO DELETE-COUNTER.      RL2054.2
041600     MOVE "****TEST DELETED****" TO RE-MARK.                      RL2054.2
