045100  END-ROUTINE-12.                                                 RL2054.2
045200      MOVE "TEST(S) FAILED" TO ENDER-DESC.                        RL2054.2
045300     IF       ERROR-COUNTER IS EQUAL TO ZERO                      RL2054.2
045400         MOVE "NO " TO ERROR-TOTAL                                RL2054.2
045500         ELSE                                                     RL2054.2
