002400*                     RELATIVE  I-O DATA FILE                  *  RL2124.2
002500*             X-55   SYSTEM PRINTER                            *  RL2124.2
002600*             X-69   ADDITIONAL VALUE OF CLAUSES               *  RL2124.2
