040800*    STATEMENT FOR THE REPORT RW-FS3-REPORT-1.                    RW1034.2
040900*    REFERENCE  PAGE VIII-52, 3.1.4(5)B AND D, GENERATE STATEMENT RW1034.2
041000*                                                                 RW1034.2
