026000*        EXCEPT FOR THE DATA-NAME CLAUSE, THE CLAUSES IN A REPORT RW1044.2
026100*    GROUP DESCRIPTION ENTRY MAY BE WRITTEN IN ANY SEQUENCE.      RW1044.2
