017300     OPEN     OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.                                  SG1014.2
017400     MOVE CCVS-PGM-ID TO TEST-ID. MOVE CCVS-PGM-ID TO ID-AGAIN.   SG1014.2
017500     MOVE    SPACE TO TEST-RESULTS.                               SG1014.2
