017700     GO TO CCVS1-EXIT.                                            SG1014.2
017800 CLOSE-FILES.                                                     SG1014.2
017900     PERFORM END-ROUTINE THRU END-ROUTINE-13. CLOSE PRINT-FILE.   SG1014.2
