027100*             ORDER --- 8 7 6 5 4 3 1 2 --- THAT IS,              SG1044.2
027200*             THE 8TH RECORD SORTS UP TO THE 1ST POSITION,        SG1044.2
027300*             THE 7TH RECORD SORTS UP TO THE 2ND POSITION, ETC.   SG1044.2
027400 SORT-TEST-1.                                                     SG1044.2
