054800      IF   INSPECT-COUNTER EQUAL TO ZERO                          SG1044.2
054900          MOVE "NO " TO ERROR-TOTAL                               SG1044.2
055000      ELSE MOVE INSPECT-COUNTER TO ERROR-TOTAL.                   SG1044.2
055100      MOVE "TEST(S) REQUIRE INSPECTION" TO ENDER-DESC.            SG1044.2
055200      MOVE CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.          SG1044.2
