054600     MOVE "TEST(S) DELETED     " TO ENDER-DESC.                   SG1064.2
054700     MOVE CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           SG1064.2
054800      IF   INSPECT-COUNTER EQUAL TO ZERO                          SG1064.2
