028700 FAIL.  MOVE "FAIL*" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO ERROR-COUNTER.          SM1014.2
028800 DE-LETE.  MOVE "*****" TO P-OR-F.  ADD 1 TO DELETE-COUNTER.      SM1014.2
028900     MOVE "****TEST DELETED****" TO RE-MARK.                      SM1014.2
