019100     02 FILLER  PIC IS X(65)    VALUE IS "************************SM1024.2
019200-    "*****************************************".                 SM1024.2
019300     02 FILLER  PIC IS X(54)    VALUE IS "************************SM1024.2
019400-    "******************************".                            SM1024.2
