031600     GO TO CCVS1-EXIT.                                            SM2014.2
031700 CLOSE-FILES.                                                     SM2014.2
031800     PERFORM END-ROUTINE THRU END-ROUTINE-13. CLOSE PRINT-FILE.   SM2014.2
