069400             PERFORM PRINT-DETAIL.                                SM2064.2
069500     ADD     1 TO REC-CT.                                         SM2064.2
069600 PST-TEST-11-3.                                                   SM2064.2
069700     MOVE   "PST-TEST-11-3" TO PAR-NAME.                          SM2064.2
069800     IF      WRK-DU-99-LONGER = 10                                SM2064.2
