024000     MOVE     SPACE TO RE-MARK.                                   SM2084.2
024100 HEAD-ROUTINE.                                                    SM2084.2
024200     MOVE CCVS-H-1  TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.  SM2084.2
