000400****************************************************************  SQ1024.2
000500*                                                              *  SQ1024.2
000600*    VALIDATION FOR:-                                          *  SQ1024.2
000700*    "ON-SITE VALIDATION, NATIONAL INSTITUTE OF STD & TECH.     ".SQ1024.2
000800*    USING CCVS85 VERSION 1.0 ISSUED IN JANUARY 1986.          *  SQ1024.2
