026800P    OPEN I-O RAW-DATA.                                           SQ1124.2
026900P    MOVE CCVS-PGM-ID TO RAW-DATA-KEY.                            SQ1124.2
027000P    READ RAW-DATA INVALID KEY GO TO END-E-1.                     SQ1124.2
