092300*        THIS TEST CHECKS IF THERE WERE ANY ERRORS IN THE         SQ1164.2
092400*    UPDATED FILE AND READS THE FILE ONCE MORE EXPECTING          SQ1164.2
092500*    THE AT END CONDITION TO OCCUR.                               SQ1164.2
