048000     IF COUNT-OF-RECS EQUAL TO 150                                SQ1174.2
048100         GO TO WRITE-INIT-GF-04-A.                                SQ1174.2
048200     GO TO WRITE-INIT-GF-03-A.                                    SQ1174.2
