048600*    ARE SET TO JUNK WHICH SHOULD BE REPLACED WITH BLANKS DURING  SQ1174.2
048700*    THE WRITE...FROM STATEMENT.  THE IDENTIFIER IS LEVEL 02.     SQ1174.2
