030800 DECL-PASS.                                                       SQ1224.2
030900     MOVE   "PASS " TO P-OR-F.                                    SQ1224.2
031000     ADD     1 TO PASS-COUNTER.                                   SQ1224.2
031100     PERFORM DECL-PRINT-DETAIL.                                   SQ1224.2
031200*                                                                 SQ1224.2
