033400     MOVE    SPACE TO RE-MARK.                                    SQ1224.2
033500*                                                                 SQ1224.2
033600 DECL-WRITE-LINE.                                                 SQ1224.2
033700     ADD     1 TO RECORD-COUNT.                                   SQ1224.2
033800Y    IF RECORD-COUNT GREATER 50                                   SQ1224.2
033900Y        MOVE    DUMMY-RECORD TO DUMMY-HOLD                       SQ1224.2
