060400*                                                              *  SQ1294.2
060500*    THIS POINT MARKS THE END OF THE CCVS MONITOR ROUTINES AND *  SQ1294.2
060600*    THE START OF THE TESTS OF SPECIFIC COBOL FEATURES.        *  SQ1294.2
060700*                                                              *  SQ1294.2
