058800     MOVE    1 TO REC-CT.                                         SQ1354.2
058900     MOVE   "CLOSE-TEST-02" TO PAR-NAME                           SQ1354.2
059000     MOVE   "CLOSE OF CLOSED FILE" TO FEATURE.                    SQ1354.2
059100 CLOSE-TEST-02.                                                   SQ1354.2
059200     CLOSE   SQ-FS1.                                              SQ1354.2
