059200     MOVE 1 TO REC-CT.                                            SQ1514.2
059300 WRITE-TEST-01.                                                   SQ1514.2
059400     WRITE SQ-FS1R1-F-G-120.                                      SQ1514.2
059500*                                                                 SQ1514.2
