032000     IF REC-CT NOT EQUAL TO ZERO                                  SQ1564.2
032100         MOVE   "." TO PARDOT-X                                   SQ1564.2
032200         MOVE    REC-CT TO DOTVALUE.                              SQ1564.2
032300     MOVE    TEST-RESULTS TO PRINT-REC.                           SQ1564.2
032400     PERFORM WRITE-LINE.                                          SQ1564.2
032500     IF P-OR-F EQUAL TO "FAIL*"                                   SQ1564.2
032600         PERFORM WRITE-LINE                                       SQ1564.2
032700         PERFORM FAIL-ROUTINE THRU FAIL-ROUTINE-EX                SQ1564.2
032800     ELSE                                                         SQ1564.2
032900         PERFORM BAIL-OUT THRU BAIL-OUT-EX.                       SQ1564.2
