049700     WRITE SQ-FS1R1-F-G-120.                                      SQ1564.2
049800     IF SQ-FS1-STATUS = "48"                                      SQ1564.2
049900         PERFORM PASS                                             SQ1564.2
050000     ELSE                                                         SQ1564.2
