046700     PERFORM DE-LETE.                                             SQ2034.2
046800     GO TO READ-WRITE-GF-02.                                      SQ2034.2
046900 READ-FAIL-GF-02.                                                 SQ2034.2
047000     MOVE "VII-7 2.3.2; VII-8 2.3.4 (2); GR (4) B, (10)"          SQ2034.2
047100        TO RE-MARK.                                               SQ2034.2
