028500P    READ RAW-DATA INVALID KEY GO TO END-E-1.                     SQ2054.2
028600P    MOVE "ABORTED " TO C-ABORT.                                  SQ2054.2
028700P    ADD 1 TO C-NO-OF-TESTS.                                      SQ2054.2
