028900P    ACCEPT C-TIME  FROM TIME.                                    SQ2054.2
029000P    REWRITE RAW-DATA-SATZ INVALID KEY GO TO END-E-1.             SQ2054.2
029100PEND-E-1.                                                         SQ2054.2
029200P    CLOSE RAW-DATA.                                              SQ2054.2
