026700P    MOVE CCVS-PGM-ID TO RAW-DATA-KEY.                            SQ2094.2
026800P    READ RAW-DATA INVALID KEY GO TO END-E-2.                     SQ2094.2
026900P    MOVE "OK.     " TO C-ABORT.                                  SQ2094.2
