042100     MOVE "WRITE-TEST-GF-03" TO PAR-NAME.                         SQ2094.2
042200     PERFORM PRINT-DETAIL.                                        SQ2094.2
042300     MOVE INFO-LINE-2 TO PRINT-REC.                               SQ2094.2
