020100 01  HYPHEN-LINE.                                                 SQ2104.2
020200     02 FILLER PICTURE IS X VALUE IS SPACE.                       SQ2104.2
020300     02 FILLER PICTURE IS X(65) VALUE IS "************************SQ2104.2
