036300     MOVE    CCVS-E-2        TO DUMMY-RECORD                      SQ2114.2
036400     PERFORM WRITE-LINE.                                          SQ2114.2
036500     MOVE   "TEST(S) FAILED" TO ENDER-DESC.                       SQ2114.2
036600     IF ERROR-COUNTER IS EQUAL TO ZERO                            SQ2114.2
