037700     MOVE   "TEST(S) DELETED     " TO ENDER-DESC.                 SQ2114.2
037800     MOVE    CCVS-E-2 TO DUMMY-RECORD.                            SQ2114.2
037900     PERFORM WRITE-LINE.                                          SQ2114.2
