001500*                                                              *  SQ2264.2
001600*      X-CARDS USED BY THIS PROGRAM ARE :-                     *  SQ2264.2
001700*                                                              *  SQ2264.2
001800*            X-14   SEQUENTIAL MASS STORAGE FILE               *  SQ2264.2
