028000     MOVE    CCVS-PGM-ID TO ID-AGAIN.                             SQ2304.2
028100     MOVE    SPACE TO TEST-RESULTS.                               SQ2304.2
028200     PERFORM HEAD-ROUTINE THRU COLUMN-NAMES-ROUTINE.              SQ2304.2
028300     MOVE    ZERO TO REC-SKEL-SUB.                                SQ2304.2
028400     PERFORM CCVS-INIT-FILE 10 TIMES.                             SQ2304.2
028500     GO TO CCVS1-EXIT.                                            SQ2304.2
028600*                                                                 SQ2304.2
028700 CCVS-INIT-FILE.                                                  SQ2304.2
028800     ADD     1 TO REC-SKL-SUB.                                    SQ2304.2
