002400*        + IS PLUS                                                ST1064.2
002500*                                                                 ST1064.2
002600*    THIS PROGRAM BUILDS A FILE OF NINE RECORDS. EACH RECORD HAS  ST1064.2
002700*    THREE KEYS, AND THE VALUES OF THE RECORDS ARE SHOWN BELOW-   ST1064.2
002800*             S                                                   ST1064.2
