047600     MOVE     FOURTH-20-CR TO CORRECT-A.                          ST1114.2
047700     MOVE     "FOURTH TWENTY CHARACTERS" TO RE-MARK.              ST1114.2
047800     PERFORM  PRINT-DETAIL.                                       ST1114.2
