062100     MOVE   ANSI-REFERENCE TO INF-ANSI-REFERENCE.                 ST1184.2
062200     MOVE   XXINFO TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE 2 TIMES.   ST1184.2
