034500     MOVE CCVS-E-3 TO DUMMY-RECORD. PERFORM WRITE-LINE.           ST1254.2
034600 WRITE-LINE.                                                      ST1254.2
034700     ADD 1 TO RECORD-COUNT.                                       ST1254.2
