042900     CLOSE    SORTOUT-2F.                                         ST1254.2
043000     CLOSE    SORTOUT-3F.                                         ST1254.2
043100                                                                  ST1254.2
043200 INPROC-EXIT SECTION.                                             ST1254.2
043300 EXITPARA.                                                        ST1254.2
043400     PERFORM CLOSE-FILES.                                         ST1254.2
