043800     SORT     FIRST-SORTFILE  ON DESCENDING KEY                   ST1334.2
043900              FIRST-KEY                                           ST1334.2
044000              INPUT PROCEDURE INPROC                              ST1334.2
044100              GIVING SORTOUT-2C.                                  ST1334.2
