009300*                                                                 ST1474.2
009400*    OPTIONS RECOMMENDED -                                        ST1474.2
009500*    *   OPT SW6 - X   TO BE USED IF NECESSARY TO DUMP THE        ST1474.2
009600*                      FILES AS THEY ARE CREATED AND READ         ST1474.2
009700*                      DURING TESTS 3 THRU 8, 11 THRU 16,         ST1474.2
